# AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Associate Study Guide

This section contains my personal study materials for the **AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Associate (SAA)** certification.

I have organized my notes into individual PDF study guides by topic so that specific AWS services and concepts can be reviewed independently. For those who prefer everything in one place, a comprehensive study guide containing all of my notes is also available at the bottom of this page.

## Study Resources & Acknowledgments

These notes were created as part of my preparation for the **AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Associate** certification.

A major resource used throughout my studies was **Stéphane Maarek's AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate course on Udemy**, along with his **AWS Solutions Architect Associate practice examinations**.

His course and practice exams provided much of the instructional foundation I used while learning AWS services and preparing for the certification exam.

Additional learning came from hands-on work within AWS and AWS documentation.

## Disclaimer

These study guides are personal learning materials and are not official AWS training materials. AWS service features and certification objectives may change over time, so readers should verify current information against official AWS documentation.
